  "body": "DAILY INSPECTIONS AVAILABLE BY APPOINTMENT!\r\n\r\nFancy an early morning viewing before work, or perhaps catching the evening light over Orewa? Why wait for an open home? Just give me a call and let's arrange a time that suits you!\r\n\r\nIf you've been dreaming of less maintenance, more freedom and a lifestyle that feels like a permanent holiday, this could be your moment!\r\n\r\nImagine morning walks along Orewa Beach, coffee on your balcony overlooking the coastline, and cafés, restaurants and boutique shopping just moments from your door. No lawns to mow, no weekends lost to maintenance, just more time to enjoy the things you love.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the iconic Nautilus, this approximately 63m² one-bedroom plus study apartment combines coastal views, easy-care living and resort-style facilities in one fantastic central location.\r\n\r\nLESS MAINTENANCE. MORE FREEDOM. MORE TIME TO ENJOY!\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, looking for a weekend escape or searching for the ultimate lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, here's your chance to secure your own piece of central Orewa.\r\n\r\n• One bedroom plus versatile study\r\n• Approximately 63m² of easy-care living\r\n• Private balcony with wide coastal views\r\n• Two secure car parks plus storage locker\r\n• Swimming pool, spa, sauna, gym and BBQ facilities\r\n• Beach, cafés, restaurants and shops just moments away\r\n\r\nTHE OWNER HAS ALREADY MADE THEIR MOVE. NOW IT'S YOUR TURN!\r\n\r\nWhy keep dreaming of living by the beach when you could be enjoying it every day?\r\n\r\nCONTACT ME TODAY TO ARRANGE YOUR PRIVATE VIEWING!\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of these particulars, no warranty is given by the vendor or the agent as to their accuracy. Interested parties should not rely on these particulars as representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise. Although high standards have been used in preparing this document, no legal responsibility can be accepted for any loss or damage resulting from the content or use of this information. Any photographs show only certain parts of the property as they appeared when taken, and some photographs may have been digitally enhanced for marketing purposes. Areas, amounts, measurements, distances, and all other numerical information are approximate only.",
